Description: Control application for the Creative Sound Blaster G8
 Graphical control application for the Creative Sound Blaster G8 USB
 sound card: Scout Mode, Direct Mode, sound mode presets, 10-band
 equalizer and preamp, bass/treble.
 .
 Installs a udev rule granting unprivileged access to the card's HID
 control interface.
